				<string>Diagnostic probe: answers whether locking the screen fires the same signal as switching apps.

Posts one notification per run. iOS Notification Center timestamps and stacks them for you, so it is already the append-only log — no file, no note, no storage permission.

Wire it to two Personal Automations for one test app: App Is Opened passes the text OPEN, App Is Closed passes the text CLOSE. Turn Ask Before Running off on both. Run it manually once and the signal reads empty, which is your baseline.</string>
