				<string>Shortcuts generated by Shortcuts Playground. May contain mistakes. Always check the shortcut's actions first.

This shortcut was created via the following user prompt:

&gt; Rebuild the Lock Signal Probe as small as it can possibly be. Three prior builds tried to persist a log — first to a Note, then to a JSON file in iCloud Drive — and every one of them fought a permission prompt or wrote nothing. Drop persistence entirely. Show a notification instead: iOS Notification Center already timestamps and stacks every notification, so it is the append-only log we were trying to build, and it needs no storage permission at all. Read Device Is Locked, post one notification naming which signal arrived, done.</string>
